   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernization of Agricultural Public Services - I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejorar la competitividad del sector agropecuario de Surinam, fortaleciendo la provisin de servicios agropecuarios e implementando instrumentos de poltica sectorial y comercial orientada a promover la inversin privada.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the competitiveness of the agricultural sector, through the stregnthening the provision of agricultural services and implementing policy instruments oriented towards promoting private farm investment.</narrative>
  </description>
